</li>
<li data-section-id="i9njrn" data-start="116" data-end="149">
<p data-start="118" data-end="149"><code data-start="118" data-end="130">.gitignore</code>: <strong data-start="132" data-end="149">No .gitignore</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1x4f42b" data-start="150" data-end="175">
<p data-start="152" data-end="175">License: <strong data-start="161" data-end="175">No license</strong></p>
</li>
