L\",\"AM\",\"AR\",\"AZ\",\"BA\",\"BB\",\"BD\",\"BG\",\"BH\",\"BM\",\"BN\",\"BT\",\"CL\",\"CO\",\"CR\",\"CV\",\"CY\",\"DO\",\"DZ\",\"EC\",\"EG\",\"ET\",\"FO\",\"GE\",\"GI\",\"GN\",\"GT\",\"GW\",\"HN\",\"HR\",\"HT\",\"ID\",\"IL\",\"IN\",\"IQ\",\"IS\",\"JO\",\"KE\",\"KG\",\"KH\",\"KW\",\"KY\",\"KZ\",\"LA\",\"LB\",\"LK\",\"LR\",\"LS\",\"MA\",\"MC\",\"MD\",\"ME\",\"MG\",\"MK\",\"MM\",\"MN\",\"MT\",\"MU\",\"MV\",\"MZ\",\"NA\",\"NE\",\"NG\",\"NI\",\"NP\",\"OM\",\"PE\",\"PG\",\"PH\",\"PK\",\"PY\",\"RS\",\"SA\",\"SD\",\"SI\",\"SN\",\"SO\",\"SZ\",\"TH\",\"TJ\",\"TM\",\"TN\",\"TZ\",\"UY\",\"UZ\",\"VA\",\"VC\",\"VG\",\"VN\",\"XK\",\"ZM\"]},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"462023397\":{\"name\":\"462023397\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":12,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"detection_sources\":[\"image_element_probe_v1\",\"parse_visibility_mutation_v1\",\"ad_options_dom_removal_v1\"],\"memoize_detection_for_session\":false,\"detection_source\":\"image_element_probe_v1\"},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"112877228\":{\"name\":\"112877228\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[{\"gate\":\"1007700932\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"}],\"version\":109,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"citation_output_processor\":true,\"mcps_prompt_override\":\"\",\"enable_service_connectors\":false,\"enable_mcps\":false,\"enable_toggle_p13n_connectors\":true},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"2995592449\":{\"name\":\"2995592449\",\"rule_id\":\"prestart\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":8,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{},\"is_device_based\":false,\"is_experiment_active\":false,\"is_user_in_experiment\":false},\"3635154224\":{\"name\":\"3635154224\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":60,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"connector_to_approved_scopes\":{\"connector_openai_openfda\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_cms_coverage\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_medical_records\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_clinical_trials\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_npi_registry\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_pubmed\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_rxnorm\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_cms_open_data\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_2b0a9009c9c64bf9933a3dae3f2b1254\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_medicare_care_compare\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_olympic\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_dailymed\":[\"HEALTH\"]},\"connector_to_read_scopes\":{\"connector_openai_medical_records\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_olympic\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_2b0a9009c9c64bf9933a3dae3f2b1254\":[\"HEALTH\"]},\"connector_to_allowed_with_approval_scopes\":{\"connector_691eab1e001081919e57189f8b2f03bc\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_cms_open_data\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_rxnorm\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_openfda\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_2b0a9009c9c64bf9933a3dae3f2b1254\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"asdk_app_695d990a719c819186902fa81e7e8dc6\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_cms_coverage\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_olympic\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_68f1abff1b688191b9309a31c9b4a713\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"asdk_app_6949b36d7c008191b61e56d4ada8cff2\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_medicare_care_compare\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_clinical_trials\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_pubmed\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_dailymed\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_medical_records\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_deep_research\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"asdk_app_6945d9d84c5c8191a28343ae9d7b6e8b\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_68f1afc5a6008191a701eaaab428816c\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"connector_openai_npi_registry\":[\"HEALTH\"]}},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"3689744552\":{\"name\":\"3689744552\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":82,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"lookback_days_options\":[60],\"scans_count\":5,\"lookback_days\":60,\"min_commits\":1000,\"max_commits\":10000,\"remaining_scans_cta_threshold\":5},\"is_